{"id":8137333410,"name":"Color by number ","desc":"🎨 Pixel Art Simulator 🎨\r\n\r\nCOLOR BY NUMBERS!!\r\n\r\nDRAWS CATEGORIES:\r\n🐶 Animals \r\n🔥 Anime\r\n🍔 Food\r\n🧚 Fantasy\r\n\r\n👥 Join the group to report bugs and suggest ideas 🙂 \r\nhttps://www.roblox.com/groups/13091656/Smash-Games-Lab#!/about\r\n\r\n\r\n👍LIKE IF YOU ENJOYED THE GAME🎨\r\n\r\n","path":"/game/8137333410-color-by-number","slug":"8137333410-color-by-number","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/dd760c4dd6e49054bb71188f6b8b4028b89f2e406e35d938c97f343f8f754cbf.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-bafe756b215d3a5eb65b211cf6e0967d/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":121,"visitor":109464274,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-08-02T08:41:36.247Z","creator":{"name":"Smash Games Lab","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"62e8e340ce02c7ac21a48591","title":"Auto painter","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c7832c","gameId":8137333410,"name":"Color by number ","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"slug":"8137333410-color-by-number","path":"/game/8137333410-color-by-number","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":8137333410},"slug":"Color-by-number-Auto-painter-4581","verified":true,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":97945,"executes":147,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/8137333410-1659429735131.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/8137333410-1659429735131.jpg"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/8137333410-1659429735131.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/8137333410-1659429735131.jpg"},"likeCount":3,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2022-08-02T08:41:36.247Z","updatedAt":"2022-08-02T08:41:36.247Z","lastBump":"2022-08-02T08:41:36.247Z","script":"-- Huge shoutout and thanks to Votteq https://v3rmillion.net/showthread.php?tid=1164422\nlocal plr = \"LocalPlayer\" -- Leave to LocalPlayer to paint your own, change name to paint others\nlocal maxDelay = 15 -- 15 is a good value, make higher if you're getting lag issues\nlocal plrPing = game:GetService(\"Stats\").Network.ServerStatsItem[\"Data Ping\"]:GetValue()\n\nfunction GetOwner()\n\tlocal stringy\n\t\n\tfor i,v in pairs(game:GetService(\"Workspace\").Map.Blocks:GetDescendants()) do\n\t\tif v.Name == \"OwnerFace\" and v.Parent.Name == \"SpawnLocation\" then \n\t\t\tif v:FindFirstChild(\"SurfaceGui\"):FindFirstChild(\"ImageLabel\").Image == tostring(\"rbxthumb://type=AvatarHeadShot&id=\"..game:GetService(\"Players\")[plr].UserId..\"&w=420&h=420\") then\n\t\t\t\tstringy = tostring(\"rbxthumb://type=AvatarHeadShot&id=\"..game:GetService(\"Players\")[plr].UserId..\"&w=420&h=420\")\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\tfor i,v in pairs(game:GetService(\"Workspace\").Map.Blocks:GetDescendants()) do\n\t\tif v.Name == \"OwnerFace\" and v.Parent.Name == \"SpawnLocation\" then \n\t\t\tif v:FindFirstChild(\"SurfaceGui\"):FindFirstChild(\"ImageLabel\").Image == stringy then\n\t\t\t\tstringy = v\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\treturn stringy.Parent.Parent\nend\n\nlocal usrPlot = GetOwner()\n\nlocal R = false\n\nfunction Build()\n    if R == false then \n        R = true\n\t    local remote = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\").Knit.Services.PixelGeneratorService.RF.DrawPixel\n\t    for i,v in pairs(usrPlot:WaitForChild(\"Draw\"):GetChildren()) do -- Replace WaitForChild with FindFirstChild if you want it to run per-execute\n\t        task.spawn(function()\n\t\t    if v.Name == \"Part\" and v:FindFirstChild(\"Texture\").Transparency == 0 then\n\t\t        v:FindFirstChild(\"Texture\").Transparency = 0.5 -- To avoid re-painting this and lagging out\n\t            task.wait(math.random(0,maxDelay)/2) -- I suggest leaving the max on 15. Lower may lag out, higher will take too long.\n                if plrPing > 1000 then\n                repeat task.wait()\n                until plrPing < 800 end\n                task.wait(math.random(0,maxDelay)/2)\n\t\t\t    remote:InvokeServer(v)\n\t\t    end\n\t        end)\n\t    end\n    end\n    R = false\nend\n\nBuild()","features":"Most of the base code was made by Votteq on v3rm https://v3rmillion.net/showthread.php?tid=1164422 so huge credit to them for giving me somewhere to start from.\n\nCan be a little janky at times, may require executing more than once.\n\nHow to use:\n- Load a painting and execute it (will only paint when standing on the canvas)\n- Change the name on line 2 for co-op/painting on others areas, and change the delay on line 3 if you're having lag.","tags":["auto","paint","pixel","automatic","farm"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"62e7364da190000aea61f6e1","username":"CraX","verified":true,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/62e7364da190000aea61f6e1-1659319968412.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"62e7364da190000aea61f6e1","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":5},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/62e7364da190000aea61f6e1-1659319968412.jpg"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T18:12:47.235Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e4b360710ec3c4f4e9","editBy":{"_id":"62e7364da190000aea61f6e1","username":"CraX","status":"offline","id":"62e7364da190000aea61f6e1"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-03-27T22:44:42.033Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"62e90a5c6148fb03ce9c5958","commentBy":{"_id":"626341e30d24ab41434258f4","username":"Arcturus","verified":true,"role":"admin","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3411efcd89eeb9b608aabc2f9a5dd33ecf1b4dac49369443e726ca96531fb23e.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/626341e30d24ab41434258f4-1752912578751.jpeg"},"createdAt":"2022-04-23T00:01:39.528Z","lastActive":"2026-02-11T23:50:09.601Z","status":"offline","id":"626341e30d24ab41434258f4","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3411efcd89eeb9b608aabc2f9a5dd33ecf1b4dac49369443e726ca96531fb23e.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/626341e30d24ab41434258f4-1752912578751.jpeg"}},"text":"Literally just change the size of your roller and you have a mega paint brush","createdAt":"2022-08-02T11:28:28.548Z","edited":true,"likeCount":1,"liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"62e99c4f061a281bd8b8f8e9","commentBy":{"_id":"62de83a74f5c502091d179b7","username":"Letsgoaye","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/62de83a74f5c502091d179b7-1658860965804.png"},"createdAt":"2022-07-25T11:51:03.295Z","lastActive":"2023-10-09T07:19:21.799Z","status":"offline","id":"62de83a74f5c502091d179b7","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/62de83a74f5c502091d179b7-1658860965804.png"}},"text":"It doesnt auto execute all u gotta execute each individually","createdAt":"2022-08-02T21:51:11.214Z","edited":true,"likeCount":1,"liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"62e99d160d6b632d7652cd79","commentBy":{"_id":"62de83a74f5c502091d179b7","username":"Letsgoaye","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/62de83a74f5c502091d179b7-1658860965804.png"},"createdAt":"2022-07-25T11:51:03.295Z","lastActive":"2023-10-09T07:19:21.799Z","status":"offline","id":"62de83a74f5c502091d179b7","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/62de83a74f5c502091d179b7-1658860965804.png"}},"text":"Nvm works now vouch","createdAt":"2022-08-02T21:54:30.796Z","edited":true,"likeCount":1,"liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"62ea6e11ebde93fd5ed251d8","commentBy":{"_id":"61b24d65825ec1c8fcd3a435","username":"MoCap","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"createdAt":"2021-12-09T18:39:33.920Z","lastActive":"2026-08-28T23:50:36.983Z","status":"offline","id":"61b24d65825ec1c8fcd3a435","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"@Valenity can you make it and then post it ?","createdAt":"2022-08-03T12:46:09.602Z","edited":true,"likeCount":1,"liked":false,"disliked":false}]},{"_id":"62777b3132953d6a460df4e6","title":"autodraw less laggy","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c7832c","gameId":8137333410,"name":"Color by number ","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"slug":"8137333410-color-by-number","path":"/game/8137333410-color-by-number","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":8137333410},"slug":"Color-by-number-autodraw-less-laggy-2484","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":6444,"executes":34,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/b75e612857d87d11c295d52c58763367/500/280/Image/Jpeg","scriptblox":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/b75e612857d87d11c295d52c58763367/500/280/Image/Jpeg"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/b75e612857d87d11c295d52c58763367/500/280/Image/Jpeg","scriptblox":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/b75e612857d87d11c295d52c58763367/500/280/Image/Jpeg"},"likeCount":4,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2022-05-08T08:11:29.817Z","updatedAt":"2022-05-08T08:11:29.817Z","lastBump":"2022-05-08T08:11:29.817Z","script":"--[[\n\tAutodraw for Color by number (8137333410)\n\tmade by Perception#7960\n]]\n\nlocal Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal Player = Players.LocalPlayer\n\nlocal Map = workspace.Map\nassert(Map, \"Could not find the Map in workspace\")\nlocal Blocks = Map.Blocks\nassert(Blocks, \"Could not find Blocks in the Map\")\nlocal plrBlock\n\nfor _,v in pairs (Blocks:GetChildren()) do\n\tlocal Block = v\n\tif v:FindFirstChildWhichIsA(\"SpawnLocation\") then\n\t\tv = v:FindFirstChildWhichIsA(\"SpawnLocation\")\n\t\tif v:FindFirstChild(\"OwnerFace\") and v:FindFirstChild(\"OwnerFace\"):IsA(\"BasePart\") then\n\t\t\tlocal OwnerFace = v:FindFirstChild(\"OwnerFace\")\n\t\t\tif OwnerFace:FindFirstChildWhichIsA(\"SurfaceGui\") then\n\t\t\t\tlocal SurfaceGui = OwnerFace:FindFirstChildWhichIsA(\"SurfaceGui\")\n\t\t\t\tif SurfaceGui:FindFirstChildWhichIsA(\"ImageLabel\") then\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal ImageLabel = SurfaceGui:FindFirstChildWhichIsA(\"ImageLabel\")\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal Image = ImageLabel.Image\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal UserId = string.split(string.split(Image, '&')[2], '=')[2]\n\t\t\t\t\tif tonumber(UserId) == Player.UserId then\n\t\t\t\t\t\tplrBlock = Block\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\nend\n\nlocal Draw = plrBlock.Draw\nlocal remote = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\").Knit.Services.PixelGeneratorService.RF.DrawPixel\n\nfor _, v in pairs(Draw:GetChildren()) do\n\tif v:FindFirstChildWhichIsA(\"Decal\") then\n\t\tlocal Texture = v:FindFirstChildWhichIsA(\"Decal\")\n\t\tif v.Name == 'Part' and Texture.Transparency == 0.75 or Texture.Transparency == 0 then\n\t\t\ttask.spawn(function()\n\t\t\t\ttask.wait(math.random(0,30))\n\t\t\t\tTexture.Transparency = 0.1\n\t\t\t\tremote:InvokeServer(v)\n\t\t\tend)\n\t\tend\n\tend\nend","features":"Autodraws your current drawing in color by number","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"624ff5b428fd9cc3df0d0ee1","username":"trollar","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/624ff5b428fd9cc3df0d0ee1-1649407450471.png"},"status":"offline","id":"624ff5b428fd9cc3df0d0ee1","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/624ff5b428fd9cc3df0d0ee1-1649407450471.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T18:13:22.762Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e2b360710ec3c4b4a7","editBy":{"_id":"624ff5b428fd9cc3df0d0ee1","username":"trollar","status":"offline","id":"624ff5b428fd9cc3df0d0ee1"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2022-05-08T08:11:50.183Z"},{"_id":"67e5e1e2b360710ec3c4b4a8","editBy":{"_id":"624ff5b428fd9cc3df0d0ee1","username":"trollar","status":"offline","id":"624ff5b428fd9cc3df0d0ee1"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2022-05-08T08:56:25.686Z"},{"_id":"67e5e1e2b360710ec3c4b4a9","editBy":{"_id":"624ff5b428fd9cc3df0d0ee1","username":"trollar","status":"offline","id":"624ff5b428fd9cc3df0d0ee1"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2022-05-08T08:56:38.701Z"},{"_id":"67e5e1e4b360710ec3c4f2e1","editBy":{"_id":"624ff5b428fd9cc3df0d0ee1","username":"trollar","status":"offline","id":"624ff5b428fd9cc3df0d0ee1"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2025-03-27T09:27:00.900Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"6278071dd405e8adedc7bd23","commentBy":{"_id":"61e049124979dbf4c0032ac5","username":"Chen","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/1837ae4f9390fc55ac6491a82a70b2e54b86b7cfd1422ee5e668922544c95a79.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/61e049124979dbf4c0032ac5-1742377150549.png"},"createdAt":"2022-01-13T15:45:22.724Z","lastActive":"2025-04-13T07:50:24.224Z","status":"offline","id":"61e049124979dbf4c0032ac5","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/1837ae4f9390fc55ac6491a82a70b2e54b86b7cfd1422ee5e668922544c95a79.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/61e049124979dbf4c0032ac5-1742377150549.png"}},"text":"Is it possible to add an anti kick protection, to draw bigger pictures?","createdAt":"2022-05-08T18:08:29.165Z","edited":true,"likeCount":1,"liked":false,"disliked":false}]},{"_id":"626d53b7b00495125bd3ca23","title":"Near Instant Paint","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c7832c","gameId":8137333410,"name":"Color by number ","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"slug":"8137333410-color-by-number","path":"/game/8137333410-color-by-number","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":8137333410},"slug":"Color-by-number-Near-Instant-Paint-2337","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":3254,"executes":38,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/b75e612857d87d11c295d52c58763367/500/280/Image/Jpeg","scriptblox":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/b75e612857d87d11c295d52c58763367/500/280/Image/Jpeg"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/b75e612857d87d11c295d52c58763367/500/280/Image/Jpeg","scriptblox":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/b75e612857d87d11c295d52c58763367/500/280/Image/Jpeg"},"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2022-04-30T15:20:23.097Z","updatedAt":"2022-04-30T15:20:23.097Z","lastBump":"2022-04-30T15:20:23.097Z","script":"-- Huge shoutout and thanks to Votteq https://v3rmillion.net/showthread.php?tid=1164422\nfunction GetOwner()\nlocal stringy\n\nfor i,v in pairs(game:GetService(\"Workspace\").Map.Blocks:GetDescendants()) do\nif v.Name == \"OwnerFace\" and v.Parent.Name == \"SpawnLocation\" then \nif v:FindFirstChild(\"SurfaceGui\"):FindFirstChild(\"ImageLabel\").Image == tostring(\"rbxthumb://type=AvatarHeadShot&id=\"..game:GetService(\"Players\").LocalPlayer.UserId..\"&w=420&h=420\") then\nstringy = tostring(\"rbxthumb://type=AvatarHeadShot&id=\"..game:GetService(\"Players\").LocalPlayer.UserId..\"&w=420&h=420\")\nend\nend\nend\n\nfor i,v in pairs(game:GetService(\"Workspace\").Map.Blocks:GetDescendants()) do\nif v.Name == \"OwnerFace\" and v.Parent.Name == \"SpawnLocation\" then \nif v:FindFirstChild(\"SurfaceGui\"):FindFirstChild(\"ImageLabel\").Image == stringy then\nstringy = v\nend\nend\nend\nreturn stringy.Parent.Parent\nend\n\nlocal usrPlot = GetOwner()\n\nlocal R = false\n\nfunction Build()\n   if R == false then \n       R = true\n   local remote = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\").Knit.Services.PixelGeneratorService.RF.DrawPixel\n   for i,v in pairs(usrPlot:WaitForChild(\"Draw\"):GetChildren()) do -- Replace WaitForChild with FindFirstChild if you want it to be per-execute\n       task.spawn(function()\n   if v.Name == \"Part\" and v:WaitForChild(\"Texture\").Transparency == 0 then\n       v:FindFirstChild(\"Texture\").Transparency = 0.1 -- To avoid re-painting this and lagging out\n           task.wait(math.random(0,15)) -- I suggest leaving the max on 15. Lower may lag out, higher will take too long.\n   remote:InvokeServer(v)\n   end\n       end)\n   end\n   end\n   R = false\nend\n\nfunction IsNoSurvivors()\n   local te = 0\n   for i,v in pairs(GetOwner().Draw:GetChildren()) do\nif v.Name == \"Part\" and v:FindFirstChild(\"Texture\") then\nif v.Name == \"Part\" and v:FindFirstChild(\"Texture\").Transparency ~= 0.75 or v:FindFirstChild(\"Texture\").Transparency ~= 0 then\nte = te + 1\nend\nend\nend\n   return te\nend\n\nwhile IsNoSurvivors() ~= 0 do\ntask.wait()\nBuild()\nend","features":"rEaD tHe ScRiPt NaMe 💀","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"626d3b0232953d6a46f110b3","username":"Skulls","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"